      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Book of Dust is a forthcoming trilogy of fantasy novels by Philip Pullman. It is a companion trilogy to the \"His Dark Materials\" trilogy. The first book is set 10 years before \"Northern Lights\" and centres on Lyra Belacqua, one of the protagonists of the original trilogy. Alethiometers, dæmons and the Magisterium also return, alongside new characters, including a new hero.",
